roke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-F7\" d=\"M318 466Q318 500 339 518T386 537Q418 537 438 517T458 466Q458 438 440 417T388 396Q355 396 337 417T318 466ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H706Q721 262 721 250T706 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM318 34Q318 68 339 86T386 105Q418 105 438 85T458 34Q458 6 440 -15T388 -36Q355 -36 337 -15T318 34Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJSZ1-28\" x=\"0\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-31\" x=\"458\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1181\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2181,0)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.574)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"486\" y=\"780\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-221A\" x=\"0\" y=\"3\"></use>\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1779\" height=\"60\" x=\"833\" y=\"744\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(833,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(778,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-37\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJSZ1-29\" x=\"4794\" y=\"-1\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-F7\" x=\"5475\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"6476\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>.</p>\n<p>To evaluate expressions with radicals, we use PEMDAS as before, but with the following additional rules:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>expressions underneath radicals are treated the same as parentheses</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>radicals themselves are treated as exponents</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Following the order of operations, we obtain:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"21.498ex\" height=\"22.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -10.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -5025.1 9256.1 9547.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"Mat